;=============================================================================
; ddkImmortalCore.per -- 1:1 TRANSCRIPTION of Immortal v0d10f's cavalry-archer
; control pipeline (extracted + line-verified 2026-07-02), reduced to: ONE ball,
; tag 1, enemy = player 3, cavalry-archer line. NOT a reinterpretation -- every
; rule cites its Immortal source; deviations are marked "; DEVIATION".
;
; RULE NUMBERING IS LOAD-BEARING: up-jump-direct targets are absolute defrule
; indices (0-based). Rules 0-77 are jump-target-exact; rules 78+ (diagnostics +
; the ddkModelAI parameterization appendix) are numbering-free -- nothing jumps there.
;
; ddkSquareV18 = ddkSquareV7 (arrival-gated A<->B oscillation, arc 0..600) + P/E/D/N probe.
;   Movement byte-identical to V7; probe added to record how it really behaves in this scenario.
;
; ddkModelAI = CoreF + per-unit kiting character + broad ranged recognition +
; robust dynamic-enemy detection.  Values from data/golden/aoe2_reference.db:
;   * W_fire = final_attack_delay(ms) + 60ms release margin, keyed on the ball's
;     median ACTUAL type (obj1), class fallback.
;   * kite dwell = clamp(liveReload - 1400, 400, 2200).
;   * kite ONLY when out-ranging (gRange > gERange+1); else hold VOLLEY.
;   * strafe/step speed-tiered.
;   * RANGED = continuous projectile shooter: the 4 ranged classes PLUS the
;     melee-class throwers (gbeto/throwing-axeman/mameluke) and ballista elephant,
;     added by unit type. Charge one-shots (Fire Lancer) are NOT ranged.
;
; Pipeline: TIME (real ms via timer idiom) -> SN blocks (engine AI off) ->
; CLUSTERING beat ~4s (groups 8/9 snapshot + tag-write trio) -> STATE MACHINE
; every pass (tag filter, group stats incl. %fired/%ready loops, enemy scan,
; %in-range, farthest-first sort) -> transitions 22<->18 (verbatim thresholds)
; -> KITE (verbatim point math + double-issued formation-line patrol/move) ->
; VOLLEY (verbatim round-robin focus fire with arrow budgeting).
;=============================================================================

